        "question_Wrpfdn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What can I personalise?",
            "answer": "<p>Our Made to Order collection currently includes rings and necklaces. Depending on the style, you can:</p><ul><li>Select your <strong>birthstones</strong></li><li>Add a personal <strong>engraving</strong></li><li>Choose <strong>initials</strong></li></ul><p>Each product page shows the options available for that specific piece.</p>"
