        "question_GRPVc4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will my piece take to arrive?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Making Your Piece</strong></p><p>Because each piece is made to order, please allow <strong>2–3 weeks</strong> for it to be crafted and dispatched. During busier periods, sale events, holidays, and new launches - this can take a little longer.<br/><br/><strong>Delivering Your Piece</strong></p><p>Delivery time is additional to this and depends on your location and the shipping method you choose. </p>"
          }
        },
        "question_ApWGWz": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change my order after I've placed it?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, within <strong>60 minutes</strong> of placing your order.</p><p>Before you check out, you'll see a confirmation screen that summarises everything you've chosen: size, engraving, birthstone, initials. Please check it carefully, because it's the final step before we begin making your piece. If you spot something within 60 minutes of ordering, <a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/contact\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/contact\">[contact us] </a>straight away and we'll help.</p><p>After that 60-minute window, your piece has entered production, and the details can no longer be changed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_NmhzxV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I cancel, return or exchange a Made to Order piece?",
            "answer": "<p>Because each piece is made specifically for you, Made to Order items <strong>can't be cancelled</strong>, <strong>returned, or exchanged</strong> - including a change of size. This is standard for personalised pieces, and it's<br/>the reason we ask you to confirm every detail before checkout.</p><p>Because each piece is made specifically for you, Made to order items are <strong>final sale.</strong> That means no returns or exchanges.<br/><br/>You'll have <strong>60 minutes after ordering to amend your details</strong>; after that your piece is in production and can't be changed. So please check everything before you order.<br/><br/>And if a Lab piece ever arrives faulty, we'll always make it right — <strong>see our </strong><a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/5-year-warranty\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/5-year-warranty\"><strong>5-year warranty.</strong></a></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_XCa3bd": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is my piece covered by a warranty?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Yes, all products are covered by a 5-year warranty </strong>to give you complete peace of mind against any manufacturing faults or defects. <br/><br/>These pieces aren't just jewellery; they are symbols of love, commitment, and cherished moments.</p><p>That's why we stand by our products. Full warranty terms <a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/5-year-warranty\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/5-year-warranty\">here</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_CiPyzw": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I make sure I order the right size?",
            "answer": "<p>Use our <a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/ring-size-guide\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/ring-size-guide\">size guide</a> to check, and if you're between sizes or unsure, <a href=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/contact\" title=\"https://thepromiseco.com/pages/contact\">reach out to us </a>before placing your order. We want to help you get it right first time.</p>"
